GEMMA MODEL WEIGHTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Distributed builds of the Work may include a copy of Google's Gemma model
weights ("Gemma"), which the Work uses to write some of its text while you
play, locally on your own machine.

Gemma is NOT part of the Work and is NOT licensed under this license. Gemma
is provided under and subject to the Gemma Terms of Use found at
ai.google.dev/gemma/terms. A copy of those Terms, of the Gemma Prohibited
Use Policy, and of the required notice, is included with every build that
contains Gemma, in the "Licenze" folder next to the game.

Nothing in this license restricts, or is intended to restrict, any right you
have in Gemma under the Gemma Terms of Use. If this license and the Gemma
Terms of Use disagree as to Gemma, the Gemma Terms of Use prevail.

USE RESTRICTIONS (binding). As a condition of your use of the Work, you must
not use Gemma or any Model Derivative:
  - for the restricted uses set out in the Gemma Prohibited Use Policy at
    ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy; or
  - in violation of applicable laws and regulations.
Gemma and Model Derivatives are subject to those use restrictions, and this
provision is included as required by Section 3.1 of the Gemma Terms of Use.

Google claims no rights in the text Gemma generates on your machine, and you
are solely responsible for that text and its subsequent use (Gemma Terms of
Use, Section 3.3). The copyright holder of the Work makes no warranty as to
generated text, which is produced on your device and is not reviewed by
anyone before you read it.

Gemma and Google are trademarks of Google LLC. The Work is not affiliated
with, sponsored by, or endorsed by Google; those names are used only to
identify the model included.

THE WORK IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR
IMPLIED. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE COPYRIGHT HOLDER BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM,
DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY ARISING FROM THE WORK OR ITS USE.

For permission requests, contact the copyright holder.

